     152→
     153→## 9. Known Limitations
     154→
     155→### termbox-go in PTY
     156→- termbox-go may not initialize properly in all PTY environments
     157→- If termbox.Init() fails, the game will panic with terminal error
     158→- This is a known limitation and may cause E2E tests to fail in some environments
